.docname {Unitree Go2}
.include {docs}

Documentation of the mapping and navigation work on the Unitree Go2 robot.

## Mapping stack

The packages that turn the Go2's lidar into a map, and the topics between them.

.mermaid
    flowchart LR
      cloud["/utlidar/cloud"] --> pre[go2_preprocessor]
      state["/sportmodestate"] --> pre
      calib[(go2_calibration.yaml)] -.-> pre
      pre -->|"/utlidar/transformed_cloud"| lio[Point-LIO]
      pre -->|"/utlidar/transformed_imu"| lio
      lio -->|"/cloud_registered"| mb[map_builder]
      lio -->|"/aft_mapped_to_init"| mb
      mb --> pcd[(map.pcd)]
      mb --> tum[(trajectory.tum)]

## Saving a map

`map_builder` keeps every scan in memory and writes the files only when the session ends.

.mermaid
    sequenceDiagram
      participant P as go2_preprocessor
      participant L as Point-LIO
      participant M as map_builder
      P->>L: /utlidar/transformed_cloud, /utlidar/transformed_imu
      L->>M: /cloud_registered (each scan)
      L->>M: /aft_mapped_to_init (pose)
      Note over M: Ctrl-C
      M->>M: write map.pcd and trajectory.tum
